     "type": "output_text",
     "text": "{\"results\":[{\"title\":\"Hermes Agent Documentation | Hermes Agent\",\"url\":\"https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/docs/\",\"description\":\"The self-improving AI agent built by Nous Research. The only agent with a built-in learning loop — it creates skills from experience, improves them during use, and builds a deepening model of who you are across sessions.\"},{\"title\":\"About Hermes Agent — Open-Source AI Agent by Nous Research\",\"url\":\"https://hermes-agent.org/about/\",\"description\":\"Hermes Agent is an open-source autonomous AI agent built by Nous Research and released in February 2026. It's not a coding copilot tethered to an IDE or a chatbot wrapper around a single API. Hermes lives on your server, remembers what it learns, and gets more capable the longer it runs.\"},{\"title\":\"What Is Hermes Agent? Nous Research's Learning-Loop Agent\",\"url\":\"https://kie.ai/blog/what-is-hermes-agent\",\"description\":\"Hermes Agent is Nous Research's open-source autonomous agent with a built-in learning loop, persistent memory, and 20+ platforms. MIT licensed, launched February 25, 2026.\"}]}",
